# 1 — Origin & Production

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Source[Source / Supplier] --> Build[Build / Compilation]
  Build --> Artifact[Release Artifact]
  Artifact --> SBOM[SBOM + Component Hashes]
  SBOM --> Record[Origin Evidence Record]
```

Record: supplier, source revision, build identifier, version, artifact digest, component inventory, licenses/notices, build timestamp, signing identity, and generation context where available.

**FACT** means directly observed or cryptographically verified. **CLAIM** means supplied but not independently verified. **ATTESTATION** means an identified party has signed the statement.
